WEBVTT

00:08:30.318 --> 00:08:33.903
And while our stress hormones
are helping our bodies out,

00:08:33.927 --> 00:08:36.801
our endorphins, those feel-good chemicals,

00:08:36.825 --> 00:08:39.412
they're helping to act as a pain reliever

00:08:39.436 --> 00:08:41.119
to boost our mood.

00:08:41.143 --> 00:08:42.943
Now who wouldn't want that?

00:08:43.571 --> 00:08:47.288
There are two triggers
for the release of endorphins

00:08:47.312 --> 00:08:48.512
for most of us.

00:08:48.966 --> 00:08:50.966
Stress and pain.

00:08:51.807 --> 00:08:53.482
And for a woman giving birth,

00:08:53.506 --> 00:08:56.847
experiencing both stress and pain,

00:08:56.871 --> 00:08:58.958
endorphins, they are a gift.

00:08:59.847 --> 00:09:01.276
As the labor progresses,